# Downloaded datasets (fetch per MEMORY_BENCHMARKS.md / frontiercode README)
locomo/*.json
longmemeval/*.json
# Regenerable task sets + run outputs
frontiercode/tasks/*.json
frontiercode/results/*.json
results_*.json

# Phase 50 W7 (ADR 086 §4): results/<date>-<harness>-<model>/run.jsonl and
# summary.md are the committed "scores" — never gitignore those (they are
# the longitudinal record the leaderboard/site are generated from). Raw
# transcripts and VM artifacts a harness writes alongside them belong in a
# transcripts/ or artifacts/ subdirectory next to run.jsonl, which IS ignored:
results/*/transcripts/
results/*/artifacts/

# benchmarks/LEADERBOARD.md IS committed (regenerated via `bench-tool
# leaderboard` / `just bench-leaderboard`; tracked so `git log` gives
# regression history per ADR 086 §4).

# benchmarks/site/index.html is fully regenerable from committed results
# (`bench-tool site` / `just bench-site`) and would only grow as more runs
# land, so it stays out of git. `site/sample-index.html` is a committed,
# hand-frozen sample built from the synthetic demo runs under
# `results/*-demo-*/` so reviewers can open a real rendered page without
# building Rust; regenerate it deliberately, don't let the generator
# overwrite it silently (the bin defaults to `index.html`, not this name).
site/index.html
